      "content": "im kinda freaking out but also sort of amazed? lately everything feels... intense. i can literally see the heat coming off my cat when she's sleeping in the dark, like a glowing silhouette. and the walls in my apartment... i can hear this rhythmic electrical hum, almost like it's a low frequency song. is this like... some kind of neuro-evolutionary shift? like my brain is upgrading to process more sensory data?",
